            <ArticleTitle>Anephric state after graft nephrectomy in a patient treated with renal autotransplantation for bilateral metachronous loin pain/hematuria syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1194-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of bilateral consecutive renal autotransplantation for the loin pain/hematuria syndrome. Initial good response was followed by recurrent consecutive pain in the transplanted kidneys, necessitating bilateral graft nephrectomy and renal hemodialysis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
